WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.400
We imagine a world

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.000
in which the vast majority of people

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.800
wake up every single morning

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.900
inspired to go to work,

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.782
feel safe when they're there

00:00:07.782 --> 00:00:11.000
and return home fulfilled at the end of the day.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.400
We as an organization

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.160
see ourselves as leading a movement

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.500
to build this world.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.307
We want as many people as possible

00:00:17.307 --> 00:00:18.600
to start with WHY

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.200
to become the leaders they wish they had

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.180
so that they can build the organizations
that put people first.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.459
But we know we can't do it alone

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:27.800
which is why we're looking for

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.540
as many people as possible to join us.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:34.000
Because we know that together is better.

